LIFT MODEL
Objective of the model
We are trying to make a workable project that is similar to how a life works the main focus is to learn how to use threading how to break major problem into subproblems and solve then eventually to learn computational thinking 

Expected Working of the model
The model should take input from the user at all times
There will be two type of input the user have to provide at at time
Where the user is wishing to go up or down
Which from user wants to go to
Then the problem should make sure if its going up it only stops at the floors where the user wants to go upwards and that too should be floors higher than the current floor at which the model/life is
Then after reaching the top most called floor the model should come back down solving the same problems again

Breaking problems into sub problems

Firstly we need to make sure that when the life is going up it only stops at the floor where user is desiring to go up and should be above the current floor
Then model should be able to determine which is the top most floor
Program should recalibrate itself to its position when done reaching the top most or lower most floor
Should be able to solve the problem of user having 2 input that i going up and down from the same floor at the same consecutive times 

